@prefix fi: <urn:family-intelligence:ontology:> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

fi:Artifact a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
fi:Testimony a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
fi:Claim a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
fi:Principle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
fi:Lesson a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
fi:Extraction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Activity .
fi:HumanReview a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Activity .
fi:AccountableActor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Agent .
fi:candidateSubject a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain fi:Claim .
fi:candidateObject a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain fi:Claim .
fi:evidence a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:wasDerivedFrom .
fi:teaches a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain fi:Lesson .
fi:tenantRef a owl:DatatypeProperty .
fi:scope a owl:DatatypeProperty .
fi:reviewState a owl:DatatypeProperty .
fi:principleAuthorRef a owl:DatatypeProperty .
